{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>I am YHWH, that is My name.</b> The honorable one, for there is in all Scripture no proper noun [alone] except this alone. And this is My glory, that I reveal the future to the prophet, and they will prophesy in My name to honor Me, and I will not give My glory to another, nor My praise to idols."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:30.905924135Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}